      "stem": "塔高测量：距塔底 $40\\text{m}$ 处测得塔顶的仰角为 $30^\\circ$，求塔高（精确值）。",
      "options": null,
      "answer": {
        "kind": "application",
        "rubric": [
          {
            "key": "model",
